#N canvas 601 96 889 700 10;
#X text 10 10 DDJ-200 as controller: deck 1 (left side) drives osc 1 (left channel) -- rate fader = pitch volume fader = amp play = on/off. Deck 2 (right side) drives osc 2 (right channel) the same way. Enable DSP (Media > DSP On) to hear it.;
